        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri ogwo mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Dario, omu kwezi kwa mushanju, aha kiro kyakwo ekya makumi abiri na kimwe, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai, nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gambira Zerubabeeli, mwene Shealutieli na Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru n'abantu boona abatsigaireho oti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Beitu omuriimwe harimu otsigaireho owaareebire ekitiinisa eki enju egi yaabaire eine obunyakare? Mbwenu hati nimugireeba muta? Ti busha omu maisho gaanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka hati guma, iwe Zerubabeeli; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira; naiwe Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, guma; kandi naimwe abantu b'omuri egi nsi mwena, mugume, kandi mukore; ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naimwe; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 29:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.9.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 9:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nk'eki naaragaine naimwe, obu mwaruga Misri, oku kiri. Omwoyo wangye atuura omuriimwe, mutatiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: omu kaanya kakye niinyija kugaruka ntengyetse eiguru n'ensi, enyanja n'eitaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 52:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "60:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi ndyatengyetsa amahanga goona, eitungo ry'ago mahanga goona riije, n'egi nju ngiijuze ekitiinisa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 29:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Efeeza n'ezangye, ezaabu nazo n'ezangye; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitiinisa ky'egi nju ekya bwanyima kiryakira ekyayo eky'okubanza; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira; kandi omuri ogu myanya nimwo ndiheera obusingye; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina omu kwezi kwa mwenda omuri ogwo mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Dario, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai, nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Buuza abanyamurwa ekibuuzo eki oti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu ku yaakutwarira enyama eyeziibwe omu kicweka kya ifo eky'ekanzu ye, yaakikoza aha mugaati, nari aha kicumbe, nari omuri viinyo nari omu majuta nari aha by'okurya by'omuringo gwona, kikaaba ekirikwera? Abanyamurwa baagarukamu bati: Ngaaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.22.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 19:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hagai yaagaruka yaababuuza ati: omuntu orikushiishwa okukora aha mutumbi, ku yaakukora aha kintu kimwe ahari ebyo, kikaaba ekitashemeire? Abanyamurwa baagarukamu bati: Eego, kikaaba ekitashemeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.64.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 64:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Hagai yaagira ati: MUKAMA naagira ati: Kandi nikwo kiri n'omu maisho gangye ahari aba bantu n'ahari eri ihanga; kandi nikwo kiri n'aha murimo gwona ogu barikukoresa emikono yaabo; kandi n'eki barikuhongyerayo kyona kisiisikaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu nimbeeshengyereza, muteekateekye ebirikwija kubaho okwiha hati. Obu eibaare ryona ryabaire ritakatairwe ha rindi omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA, bikabasusira ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu omuntu yaabaire ahika aha kirundo ky'encuro makumi abiri, akashangamu ikumi ryonka; kandi obu omuntu yaabaire ahika aha bwato bwa viinyo kutahamu enjoga makumi ataano, akashanga ziri makumi abiri zonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
