        {
          "text": " Nimbeeshengyereza muteekateekye okwiha hati, aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina eky'okwezi kwa mwenda n'omu biro ebirikwija. Okwiha aha izooba eri omusingi gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA gwateereirweho, muteekateekye. ",
          "type": "text",
